      "label": "walk 함수",
      "language": "c",
      "text": "void walk(Node *p, int pre) {\n  if (!p) return;\n  if (pre)\n    printf(\"%d \", p->data);\n  walk(p->left, pre);\n  walk(p->right, pre);\n  if (!pre)\n    printf(\"%d \", p->data);\n}",
